msgstr "Włączanie pass managera Samplomatic do predefiniowanych pass managerów Qiskit {#incorporate-samplomatics-pass-manager-into-qiskit-preset-pass-managers}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The code below shows how to incorporate [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") into a Qiskit preset pass manager. The transpiled circuit is ISA and contains boxes.\n"
msgstr "Poniższy kod pokazuje, jak włączyć [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") do predefiniowanego pass managera Qiskit. Transpilowany obwód jest w postaci ISA i zawiera boxy.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/fe943b034588a5354a87abcf51b8d805c36f4f2b30a73a39c5886bce9e156b04.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/fe943b034588a5354a87abcf51b8d805c36f4f2b30a73a39c5886bce9e156b04.avif)\n"
